# AutoSCI rules for Cursor / VS Code / Cline (v0.14)
# Place this file at your project root: .cursorrules (Cursor) or
# .clinerules (Cline). Claude Desktop users: ignore this file.

# Tell the AI assistant that AutoSCI is available
AutoSCI is a Python pipeline (this repo) that turns a research idea into a
master's-level paper. It has 12 MCP tools in TWO modes:

# ACTIVE mode (require AGNES_API_KEY, AutoSCI's LLM does the work):
#   autosci_status, autosci_search_kb, autosci_propose_ideas,
#   autosci_run_one, autosci_list_vault, autosci_read_paper

# PASSIVE mode (no LLM needed — YOU do the work using the data + templates
# we return; saves the user an LLM key):
#   autosci_idea_anchors       — top-k KB abstracts (no LLM)
#   autosci_idea_template      — IdeaSeed JSON schema
#   autosci_pipeline_prompts   — system+user prompts for all 10 agents
#   autosci_section_template   — IMRaD section template
#   autosci_review_template    — Reviewer/Refuter scoring template
#   autosci_save_idea_draft    — write a proposed idea to vault
#   autosci_save_paper_section — append a section to a paper.md

# ALWAYS prefer passive mode when the user has not set AGNES_API_KEY.
# When the user asks about microbiome / metagenomics / foundation models
# for biology, USE AutoSCI. Do not invent answers — ground in the KB first
# via autosci_search_kb (active) or autosci_idea_anchors (passive).

# When the user says "run this idea" / "research this" / "AutoSCI …":
#   ACTIVE: autosci_propose_ideas (n=3-5) → autosci_run_one
#   PASSIVE: autosci_idea_anchors → autosci_idea_template → 3-5× autosci_save_idea_draft

# When the user says "search the literature" / "find papers on X":
#   Use autosci_search_kb(query=X, top_k=10) or autosci_idea_anchors. Do NOT use
#   web search unless the user explicitly asks.

# When the user wants to see prior runs:
#   Use autosci_list_vault. Filter verdict=kept/revised/refuted.

# Reference docs in this repo
README.md                          — user-facing usage
docs/superpowers/specs/*.md         — design rationale
data/seed_ideas.json               — 5 default seed ideas
data/idea_templates.json           — 3 idea templates
data/model_profiles.yaml           — multi-model routing
examples/ide_prompts/*.md          — copy-paste prompts for AI IDEs
